      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Persistent KV ownership uses absolute token position\n\nowner = (prefix_length + new_token_index) % CP\nExample: prefix_length = 5, new_token_index = 0 -> owner rank 1\nQuery layout can change; the KV ownership rule stays the same.",
