      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "e18",
      "originalText": "Persistent KV ownership uses absolute token position\n\nowner = (prefix_length + new_token_index) % CP\nExample: prefix_length = 5, new_token_index = 0 -> owner rank 1\nQuery layout can change; the KV ownership rule stays the same.",
